 (its `yaw` a turn from the facing), called once per step with the step's seconds, from the hold\n43-   * to the end of the run, so what it plays (an attack, a reaction, a movement) ends and settles on its own.\n44-   */\n45:  readonly script?: (animator: Animator, facing: number) => (dt: number) => AnimatorInput;\n46-  /** How long it holds, seconds. */\n47-  readonly seconds: number;\n48-}\n49-\n50-/** The state matrix's defaults. */\n51-export const STATE_MATRIX = {\n52-  /** Radians: ahead, and a turn that lines up with no axis (my-3d2dge's `checkRig`). */\n53-  facings: [0, 2.2],\n54-  /** Seconds at rest before each state, and after it. */\n55-  lead: 0.3,\n56-  after: 0.5,\n57-  /** Metres a joint may drift between 1/60 s and 1/120 s steps, beyond a step of its own motion (`rateDrift`). */\n58-  rate: 0.02,\n59-} as const;\n60-\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
