place('## Prompt friction','13. CRITICAL — case-four bot sweep: Gel coverage at the angular seam could quantize to the opposite sector and never finish. Coverage now wraps its circle and the bot aims at sector centres.\\\\n14. Non-critical — TV field screenshot: sphere triangles faced inward and specular light washed blood pools white. Corrected sphere winding and reduced surgical-light highlights.\\\\n\\\\n## Prompt friction');p.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
